    },
    {
      "content": "**Use case 1: Annotation**\n\n",
      "evidence_ref": "S0003",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "1. Tagger user logs into the annotation tool.\n",
      "evidence_ref": "S0004",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "2. Tagger user selects a task from the list of tasks on the Tasks screen.\n",
      "evidence_ref": "S0005",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "3. Tagger user is redirected to the Annotation screen.\n",
      "evidence_ref": "S0006",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "4. Tagger user selects the classification for the document from the classification dropdown.\n",
      "evidence_ref": "S0007",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "5. Tagger user selects labels from the labels list and places them on the document.\n",
      "evidence_ref": "S0008",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "6. Tagger user adjusts the position, size, and shape of the labels as needed.\n",
      "evidence_ref": "S0009",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "7. Tagger user edits the name and description of the labels as needed.\n",
      "evidence_ref": "S0010",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "8. Tagger user changes the color of the labels as needed.\n",
      "evidence_ref": "S0011",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "9. Tagger user clicks the save button to save their annotation progress.\n",
      "evidence_ref": "S0012",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "10. Tagger user repeats steps 5-9 until they have finished annotating the document.\n\n",
      "evidence_ref": "S0013",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
